{
  "date": "2025-10-11",
  "messages": [
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "1일차 콘서트 끝!",
      "en": "Day 1 concert over!"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "콘서트 잘 봤어어?",
      "en": "Did you enjoy the concert?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "열심히 라이브하려고했ㄴ느데",
      "en": "I tried really hard to sing live,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "잘 안들린거같아서 아쉽",
      "en": "but I was worried it wasn't heard well."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아 잘들렸어?",
      "en": "Oh, you could hear it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "다행이네ㅔ",
      "en": "That's a relief."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "오늘 힘들어하던데 괜차나??",
      "en": "You looked like you were struggling today. Are you okay??"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아니 이게사실",
      "en": "Actually..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "오늘 밥을 안먹었거든",
      "en": "I didn't eat today."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "살짝 어지러워서",
      "en": "So I felt a little dizzy."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그런거지",
      "en": "That's all it was."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "머 큰일은 아니야 걱정하쥐마",
      "en": "It's nothing serious, so don't worry."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내일은",
      "en": "Tomorrow,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "야무지게 먹을게",
      "en": "I'll make sure to eat properly."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나도 놀랐어ㅋ ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹ",
      "en": "Even I was surprised. ㅋㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아니 그리고 오늘 비하인드",
      "en": "Oh, and here's today's behind-the-scenes story."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "알려줄게",
      "en": "I'll tell you."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "오늘 빨간렌즈에 드라큘라 송곳니 끼고",
      "en": "Today I was going to wear red contact lenses and Dracula fangs,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "뱀파이어처럼 할려고 했는데",
      "en": "to look like a vampire."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "일단 렌즈 직경 너무 작아서 안이쁨 이슈",
      "en": "First issue: the contact lenses were way too small, so they didn't look good."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "작은 내 동공보다 작았어!!!",
      "en": "They were even smaller than my already tiny pupils!!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그래서 렌즈 실패",
      "en": "So the lenses were a complete fail."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "송곳니는",
      "en": "As for the fangs..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "엄마한테 어제",
      "en": "Yesterday I asked my mom"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "쿠팡으로",
      "en": "to order them from Coupang."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㄹㅋ",
      "en": "ㅋㅋㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "시켜달라고하고",
      "en": "I told her to order them,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "새벽에 받아서",
      "en": "and they arrived early in the morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "딱 꼈는데",
      "en": "I put them on,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "안껴짐 이슈",
      "en": "but they wouldn't stay on. Another issue."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그래서 앵콜때 잠깐이라도 해야지~ 하고",
      "en": "So I thought I'd at least wear them during the encore."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "끼고 나왔는데",
      "en": "I came out wearing them,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "노래 몇번부르니까",
      "en": "but after singing a few songs..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내혀 위에있는거야 ㅋㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹ",
      "en": "they somehow ended up sitting on top of my tongue. ㅋㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그래서 걍 뺌",
      "en": "So I just took them out."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "전체적으로 오늘은 뱀파이어지망생 느낌이였어",
      "en": "Overall, today I was more like a vampire trainee."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "심지어",
      "en": "On top of that..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "메이크업쌤이랑",
      "en": "My makeup artist and I"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그 송곳니에",
      "en": "even used eyelash glue"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "속눈썹 풀까지 붙혀가며",
      "en": "to attach those fangs."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "붙혔는데",
      "en": "We really tried..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그냥 이빨에 풀바른사람 됐어",
      "en": "but I just became someone with glue on their teeth."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "아니 그렇게까지 뱀파이어 하고 싶었어?",
      "en": "Did you really want to become a vampire that badly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나 진심이였어",
      "en": "I was completely serious."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋ",
      "en": "ㅋㅋㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그리고 이슈 하나 더",
      "en": "And one more issue."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "뱀파이어라",
      "en": "Since I was supposed to be a vampire..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "오늘 피부 화장을 좀",
      "en": "I made my skin makeup"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "하얗게 해봐야지~",
      "en": "extra pale."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "하고 했는데",
      "en": "But..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "땀뻘뻘 이슈로 피부 다 없어짐",
      "en": "because I was sweating so much, all the makeup disappeared."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "하하하랄",
      "en": "Hahaha."
    },
    {
  "type": "fan",
  "ko": "ㅋㅋㅋ 땀 ㄹㅇ 많이 흘리긴하더라..",
  "en": "ㅋㅋㅋ You really were sweating a lot though..."
},
{
