},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "나 원래 지적인 여자야",
  "en": "I've always been an intellectual woman."
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "물론 시험은 잘 못보지만",
  "en": "Of course, I'm not very good at exams."
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
