  "en": "But..."
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "요즘 그런거 보고싶음",
  "en": "These days I want to read those kinds of books."
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "막 광고로",
  "en": "The ones that pop up"
