},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "노트에 펜으로",
  "en": "I grab a notebook and pen,"
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "혼자 소설도 씀",
  "en": "and I even write novels on my own."
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "진짜 귀엽디",
  "en": "It's actually really cute."
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "소설 내용은",
